   "category": "Statistics",
   "text": "Lehecka beat Auger-Aliassime for the 2nd time in 5 meetings, 7-6, 6-2. Set 1 went to a tiebreak, won by Lehecka. Lehecka won 5 games in a row from 5-6 down in the first set. Lehecka landed 80% of his first serves, compared with his 63% average on hard over the last 52 weeks, won 73% of his first-serve points (48 of 66) and won 44% of his second-serve points (7 of 16), compared with his usual 54%. Lehecka's second serve is something to watch in the next round. Lehecka won 38% of the points against the first serve (28 of 74), compared with his usual 29% and 63% of the points against the second serve (10 of 16), compared with his usual 49%. Lehecka saved 9 of 9 break points.\n\nLehecka: DR: 1.28\n\nAuger-Aliassime: DR: 0.78",
